<div class="alert alert-warning">
  <strong>The AI&rsquo;s answer could not be used.</strong>
  <p class="mb-1"><%= plan.failure_reason %>.</p>
  <p class="mb-2 small">
    The answer did not match the expected shape or broke one of the split&rsquo;s rules: 8 to 14 Parts, only
    the kinds you ticked, at least half not money, and no links, payment apps or bank details. Split again, or
    edit the template in the admin panel to tighten the instructions.
  </p>
  <%= render "needs/split_button", need: need, label: "Retry",
             button_class: "btn btn-outline-warning btn-sm" %>
</div>
